      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/23/us/politics/ai-leaders-united-nations-global-response.html</guid>
      <atom:link href="https://www.nytimes.com/2026/09/23/us/politics/ai-leaders-united-nations-global-response.html" rel="standout"></atom:link>
      <description>Sam Altman of OpenAI and Dario Amodei of Anthropic told the Security Council that international cooperation was needed to ensure that A.I. remains under human control.</description>
